  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2023-12-30T07:10:34.420Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "This used to be a thing about a year or so ago.\n\nIf you are the instance owner, you can already see the people that have you blocked, I am asking to allow us to see who has us blocked in an instance. \n\nThis will help us feel better and less stressed about \"who has me blocked?\" So we can easily ask the instance owner if they can remove said user from the instance. Additionally, in doing so we can easily leave an instance if we see that a user that we have issues with to avoid drama with their friend group.",
